cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "spherical_eeg_sim: a configurable EEG source-localization dataset generator"
abstract: >-
  A standalone, reproducible generator of synthetic scalp-EEG datasets for
  training and benchmarking EEG source-localization methods. Features a
  four-sphere analytic forward model, continuous dipole orientations, point /
  multi-point / patch source modes, configurable source-position splits,
  two noise conventions (a fixed physical noise floor with emergent SNR
  and per-sample target SNR), and an independent reversible unit-RMS output
  transform.
type: software
